      {
        "text": "联邦基金目标利率区间维持在 5-1/4 至 5-1/2（5.25%–5.5%），美联储决定维持不变。",
        "kind": "model_interpretation",
        "citations": [
          {
            "source_id": "source_d91bb078ea31474fb33f1ff0a9401c93",
            "location": {
              "character_start": 675,
              "character_end": 779
            },
            "quotation_match": "whitespace_normalized",
            "support_status": "not_independently_verified",
            "quotation": "the Committee decided to maintain the\ntarget range for the federal funds rate at 5-1/4 to 5-1/2 percent."
          }
        ],
        "support_status": "not_independently_verified",
        "role": "support"
      },
      {
        "text": "后续政策将考虑的因素：继续评估新增信息及其对货币政策的影响。",
        "kind": "model_interpretation",
        "citations": [
          {
            "source_id": "source_d91bb078ea31474fb33f1ff0a9401c93",
            "location": {
              "character_start": 780,
              "character_end": 882
            },
            "quotation_match": "whitespace_normalized",
            "support_status": "not_independently_verified",
            "quotation": "The Committee will continue to\nassess additional information and its implications for monetary policy."
          }
        ],
        "support_status": "not_independently_verified",
        "role": "support"
      },
      {
        "text": "在决定进一步政策幅度时，委员会将考虑货币政策的累计收紧、货币政策影响经济活动和通胀的滞后性、以及经济和金融发展。",
        "kind": "model_interpretation",
        "citations": [
          {
            "source_id": "source_d91bb078ea31474fb33f1ff0a9401c93",
            "location": {
              "character_start": 1006,
              "character_end": 1206
            },
            "quotation_match": "whitespace_normalized",
            "support_status": "not_independently_verified",
            "quotation": "the\nCommittee will take into account the cumulative tightening of monetary policy, the lags with\nwhich monetary policy affects economic activity and inflation, and economic and financial\ndevelopments."
          }
        ],
        "support_status": "not_independently_verified",
        "role": "support"
      },
      {
        "text": "委员会还将继续缩减其持有的资产。",
        "kind": "model_interpretation",
        "citations": [
